  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186059848,
      "id": "32df8909-a239-5167-b8ea-412f7cdaea93",
      "title": "Identifying Singular Matrices"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "74019ae1-3513-5ba0-80f3-1ec4f4936c5a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $S$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $S$ is a singular matrix\n- **II.** $S$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- **III.** $det(S)=\\frac{35}{12}$\n\n$$\nS=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4} \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & -1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\\\ 2 \\sqrt{5} & -1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} & - \\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4} \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & -1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\\\ 2 \\sqrt{5} & -1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}|\\begin{aligned}-1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\\\ -1 & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+\\frac{2}{3}|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} \\\\ 2 \\sqrt{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & -1 \\\\ 2 \\sqrt{5} & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}(\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}- \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2})+\\frac{2}{3}(- \\frac{5}{2}+5)+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}(- \\sqrt{5}+2 \\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\cdot 0+\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{3}+\\frac{5}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{35}{12}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(S)=\\frac{35}{12}\\ne 0$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements II and III are true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "c911c873-9ab8-5b2f-8a63-d9b5199fff16",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "24896d0d-301d-5613-b8d0-a8769534a687",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
